  "description": "The Orleans execution model for the Stratara event-sourced stack — one activation per aggregate across the cluster, commands recorded before the call returns and resumed after a crash, projections and sagas that read the store in commit order from a checkpoint, singleton work, owner-checked durable timers and heavy work bounded across the cluster.",
